# Woodart Interiors — bridge.map
#
# What this company rolls UP to the Group through the kernel event bridge.
# Format:  <domain.event>  ->  <group.bucket>   (target account code)
# DECLARATIVE ONLY until Phase 3 wires the bridge; account codes are the TARGET
# mapping and must be reconciled with the ledger chart-of-accounts before the
# old on-read consolidation path is removed (numbers must match exactly).
#
project.invoiced     -> group.revenue    (4001)
milestone.billed     -> group.revenue    (4002)
# CORRECTED 2026-07-27 (the reconciliation this file's header asks for):
# buying stock is NOT an expense and 5002 is not in the standard chart of
# accounts. A goods receipt is DR 1400 Inventory / CR 2000 Accounts Payable;
# it becomes an expense (5000 Cost of Sales) when the material is consumed on
# a project. See companies/woodart/modules/procurement/backend/endpoints.md.
material.purchased   -> group.inventory  (1400)
expense.recorded     -> group.expense    (5001)
